{"t":1787839273080,"event":{"type":"agent:critique","iteration":0,"defects":["Most text shapes use default weight 400 (1/3 = 33% have non-default weight). Add typographic hierarchy per the LETTER SPACING RULES: page title=700 / section heading=600 / metric value=700 / metric label=500 / body=400. Also set letterSpacing (tighten headings -0.4 to -0.8, open labels +0.2 to +0.6) and textAlign. Either call pen_update_shape on each text layer OR regenerate via pen_generate_wireframe (the wireframe generator now emits rich typography per role).","No autoLayout detected on any shape. Add autoLayout=true to layout containers (cards, sidebars, topbars, tab bars) so children align automatically. The wireframe generator's post-processor adds autoLayout to these container types — if you scaffolded manually via pen_create_shape, you missed it. Call pen_update_shape with autoLayout={direction:\"vertical\", gap:8, padding:16, alignX:\"min\", alignY:\"min\"} on each card / sidebar / topbar.","Text critic (severity=medium): I'll review this Notifications section design critically, focusing only on the 10 new shapes as instructed.\n\n---\n\n## Analysis\n\n**Fidelity Check**: This is a functional UI component with proper color usage (primary blue #0ea5e9 for active toggles, white knobs, slate text). However, it lacks shadows entirely and has no gradients. The background frame uses surface-2 (#f1f5f9) appropriately. This is borderline — not a wireframe, but missing elevation polish.\n\n**Visual Hierarchy**: The \"Notifications\" title and two toggle rows appear to share the same Y position (232,850), meaning they're stacked on top of each other — this is a critical layout bug. All 10 shapes have identical coordinates, suggesting they haven't been positioned.\n\n**Toggle Implementation**: The toggles use a rounded rectangle ","VLM critic (score=3/10, severity=high):","  - [high] Add the missing 'Email updates' toggle row—currently only 'Product news' exists, violating the explicit request for two toggles","  - [high] Add visible 'Save Changes' text to the blue primary button—currently appears as unlabeled colored rectangle","  - [high] Remove all light blue-gray section backgrounds and compress vertical spacing by 60%—eliminate the zebra-striping wireframe aesthetic","  - [med] Implement proper toggle component with pill shape, smooth animation, and clear on/off states—current implementation looks amateur","  - [med] Add card border (slate-200) and shadow-sm, establish consistent 24px internal padding with strict left alignment for all elements"],"validation":{"totalShapes":10,"textShapes":3,"cardShapes":0,"textShapesWithWeight":1,"cardShapesWithShadow":0,"autoLayoutContainers":0},"textSeverity":"medium","vlmSeverity":"high","vlmScore":3}}
