{"t":1787839382142,"event":{"type":"agent:critique","iteration":1,"defects":["Text critic (severity=medium): I'll review this Notifications section critically, focusing only on the 10 new shapes.\n\n## Analysis\n\n**Fidelity Check**: This is a high-fidelity design with proper color usage (#0ea5e9 primary, #ffffff surfaces, #0f172a text), real content (\"Email updates\", \"Product news\"), and one shadow on the container. However, it's a simple utility section, not a hero/landing area, so the absence of gradients is acceptable.\n\n**Visual Hierarchy**: The section title \"Notifications\" at 14px has the same weight/size as the row labels, creating flat hierarchy. The toggles visually dominate due to their saturated #0ea5e9 color.\n\n**Alignment & Spacing**: \n- Title at y=874, first row at y=910 = 36px gap (not 8px grid)\n- Row height 28px with 20px text creates tight vertical centering\n- Toggle knobs at x=548 ap","VLM critic (score=4/10, severity=medium):","  - [high] Redesign toggle switches to modern standard: 44x24px track, 20px knob with shadow, smooth 200ms transition, clear ON/OFF colors (#0EA5E9 active, #E2E8F0 inactive), right-aligned in 48px tall rows","  - [high] Add descriptive subtext below each toggle label explaining purpose, reduce label font-weight to 400, establish clear 12px gap between rows","  - [high] Apply consistent card styling: border 1px #E2E8F0, shadow 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.05), radius 12px, padding 20px horizontal 24px vertical, match Account Settings card exactly","  - [med] Establish 8px grid system: reduce Notifications heading to 16px/600, ensure 16px margin-bottom to first row, 40px margin-bottom after last card","  - [med] Add hover (scale 1.02) and focus (2px ring) states to toggles; add 'Manage all notifications' link and '2 active' status indicator for completeness"],"validation":{"totalShapes":10,"textShapes":3,"cardShapes":0,"textShapesWithWeight":3,"cardShapesWithShadow":0,"autoLayoutContainers":5},"textSeverity":"medium","vlmSeverity":"medium","vlmScore":4}}
